  "quranSurahInsightWhyItMattersAlFurqan": "Al-Furqan matters because it distinguishes truth from noise through conduct. It shows that the servants of the Most Merciful are known by humility, discernment, and remembrance.",
  "quranSurahInsightWhyItMattersLuqman": "Luqman matters because it joins Tawhid, gratitude, family counsel, and character in one frame. It teaches that wisdom is seen in worship, advice, and humble conduct.",
