  "quranSurahInsightLessonSteadfastWorshipNeedsHelp": "Steadfast worship is not self-powered; it asks Allah for help and keeps returning to Him.",
  "quranSurahInsightLessonRememberingAllahReshapesTheHeart": "Remembering Allah is not decorative spirituality; it reforms the heart and steadies the believer.",
